United States Mission to the United Nations
Office of Press and Public Diplomacy
New York, New York
February 25, 2024
Ambassador Thomas-Greenfield’s Meeting with Canadian Minister of International Development Ahmed Hussen
The below is attributable to U.S. Mission to the United Nations Spokesperson Nate Evans:
Ambassador Linda Thomas-Greenfield, U.S. Representative to the United Nations, met today with Canadian Minister of International Development Ahmed Hussen. Ambassador Thomas-Greenfield expressed appreciation for Canada’s support toward a Multinational Security Support mission to Haiti. Ambassador Thomas-Greenfield and Minister Hussen discussed achieving a durable peace in the Middle East and reaffirmed joint support for Ukraine from the United States and Canada.
